    "detailed_description": "Run and manage the ultimate Board Game Cafe! Pick the board games you\u2019ll offer, keep your staff happy, your customers happier and your board games in good condition as you manage the day-to-day running of your very own board game cafe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/f9dc94aaead41efa6ad168c4c1c54e40.poster.avif?t=1732876375\" width=616 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/f9dc94aaead41efa6ad168c4c1c54e40.webm?t=1732876375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/f9dc94aaead41efa6ad168c4c1c54e40.mp4?t=1732876375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Featuring a wide range of officially licensed board games lovingly modelled for you to unbox and set up for your customers to play, Board Game Cafe allows you to fully immerse yourself in running the board game cafe of your dreams. You\u2019ll have to keep on top of your finances if you want your cafe to thrive!<br><br><strong>Do you have what it takes to become a cardboard and coffee tycoon?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/85914ed5d37735b50c297a96b9846db1.avif?t=1732876375\" width=616 height=98 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Cafe</strong></h2>Design and customise your board game cafe from the ground up! Choose from a variety of themes, furniture, and decorations to create your ideal cafe. Expand your cafe by adding more tables, host themed game nights and more!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Curate an Extensive Game Library</strong></h2>Stock your shelves with a diverse collection of board games, from classics to modern favourites. Pick and choose the types of games you want to offer, to build (and then browse) the collection of your dreams!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/6ab47df2b66cd1cfffa1b9f050e89597.poster.avif?t=1732876375\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/6ab47df2b66cd1cfffa1b9f050e89597.webm?t=1732876375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/6ab47df2b66cd1cfffa1b9f050e89597.mp4?t=1732876375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Cafe</strong></h2>Offer a wide range of snacks and treats to your customers by ordering in different foods and drinks, alongside hiring a team of skilled baristas and game gurus to provide top-notch service to your customers. Keep their mugs full and their game pieces organised to keep people coming back!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unbox and Inspect Board Games</strong></h2>Experience the excitement of cracking open a new board game! Personally unbox board games, inspect their exquisite components, and organise them with care. Marvel at the intricate game pieces, beautifully designed boards, and detailed rulebooks - all lovingly recreated digitally in Board Game Cafe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Community</strong></h2>Foster friendships and rivalries among your regulars! Watch as stories unfold over dice rolls, and get to know the board game fans in your local community as they keep coming back.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/1f9e328a2901915a712ba84bb26a4fd0.avif?t=1732876375\" width=616 height=98 /></span><br><br>Can\u2019t wait to open your own board game cafe? <strong>Wishlist Board Game Cafe now</strong> to stay up to date with the latest news!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/65cf8a326ada530aa4a2d9710ebc1e23.poster.avif?t=1732876375\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/65cf8a326ada530aa4a2d9710ebc1e23.webm?t=1732876375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/65cf8a326ada530aa4a2d9710ebc1e23.mp4?t=1732876375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
