oose the types of games you want to offer, to build (and then browse) the collection of your dreams!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/6ab47df2b66cd1cfffa1b9f050e89597.poster.avif?t=1732876375\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/6ab47df2b66cd1cfffa1b9f050e89597.webm?t=1732876375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/6ab47df2b66cd1cfffa1b9f050e89597.mp4?t=1732876375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Cafe</strong></h2>Offer a wide range of snacks and treats to your customers by ordering in different foods and drinks, alongside hiring a team of skilled baristas and game gurus to provide top-notch service to your customers. Keep their mugs full and their game pieces organised to keep people coming back!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unbox and Inspect Board Games</strong></h2>Experience the excitement of cracking open a new board game! Personally unbox board games, inspect their exquisite components, and organise them with care. Marvel at the intricate game pieces, beautifully designed boards, and detailed rulebooks - all lovingly recreated digitally in Board Game Cafe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Community</strong></h2>Foster friendships and rivalries among your regulars! Watch as stories unfold over dice rolls, and get to know the board game fans in your local community as they keep coming back.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/1f9e328a2901915a712ba84bb26a4fd0.avif?t=1732876375\" width=616 height=98 /></span><br><br>Can\u2019t wait to open your own board game cafe? <strong>Wishlist Board Game Cafe now</strong> to stay up to date with the latest news!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/65cf8a326ada530aa4a2d9710ebc1e23.poster.avif?t=1732876375\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/65cf8a326ada530aa4a2d9710ebc1e23.webm?t=1732876375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635260/extras/65cf8a326ada530aa4a2d9710ebc1e23.mp4?t=1732876375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
